  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-bootstrap-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill because it has front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow`.\n\n- **Workflow comes first:** After the `# Bootstrap requirements` title there are two short prose paragraphs with no heading. The first heading is `## Workflow`, so it is the skill's first section. The later sections (`## Inventories`, `## Proposing requirements`, `## Tagging`, `## Report`, `## Gotchas`) all come after it. The two intro paragraphs are not sections, so they don't break \"before any other section\".\n- **Ordered steps:** `## Workflow` is a numbered checklist, steps 1 to 9, with lettered sub-steps under step 7. Its lead-in says which steps run once and which repeat for each area.\n- **Violation matches:** None were listed. I found no sign of a section before `## Workflow`, or of a workflow that is unordered or placed later.\n\nThe site meets the obligation.",
